List of exams on the left sidebar
- color code for completed, running and upcoming exams

class Exam
- title: str
- course: Course
- submissions: list[Submission]

class Course
- course_code: str
- section: str
- semester: str
- year: int
- student_list: list[Student]

class Student
- id: str
- name: str
- submissions: list[submissions]

class Submission
- exam: Exam
- student: Student
- data: list[Field]

class Field
- name: str
- value: str (text input, or file_path for file input)
- type: str (text, file for now. more to come. maybe enum is better?)

Folder name format:
    <Year>-<Semster>-<Course Code>-<Section>--<Title>
Example:
    2025-Summer-CSE213-1--Quiz 1


